{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f0e1c2-6a44-4a1e-9c9e-0f4b8c2d5a11",
    "name": "Silos API",
    "description": "Collection for the Silos object storage platform.\n\nAuthentication:\n- Dashboard endpoints (/api/auth, /api/projects, /api/folders, /api/api-keys) use a JWT session cookie named `silos_session`.\n  Run `Auth / Login` first, then Postman stores the cookie automatically for subsequent requests.\n- Public API endpoints (/api/v1/*) use API Key authentication: `Authorization: Bearer <api-key>`.\n  Set the `apiKey` collection variable after creating a key.\n\nVariables:\n- baseUrl: base URL of the app (default http://localhost:3000)\n- apiKey: API key used by /api/v1/* requests\n- projectId / folderId / fileId / apiKeyId: auto-filled by the test scripts of create requests",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Login succeeded\", function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login to the dashboard. Sets the `silos_session` cookie used by all dashboard endpoints."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"new-password-min-8-chars\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "change-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Change the password of the logged in user. New password must be at least 8 characters."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Projects",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Projects",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects?search=",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "projects"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional case-insensitive project name filter",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get all projects accessible by the logged in user, including api_keys and files counts."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Project",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"projectId\", json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"my-project\",\n  \"description\": \"Demo project\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "projects"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new project. `name` must be unique. Saves the new id into the `projectId` variable."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Project",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
